Third-party connector jars go here, one subdirectory per connector:

  plugins/
    salesforce-1.2.0/
      dmp-connector-salesforce-1.2.0.jar
      <its own dependencies>.jar

Each directory is loaded by its own child-first classloader, so one connector's
dependencies cannot collide with another's. Restart the worker to pick up a change;
hot reload is deliberately unsupported.
